                <pb facs="0529" n="409" sameAs="frus:frus1905/pg409"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Minister Dawson to
                        the Secretary of State.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Santo Domingo</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1905-12-13"><hi rendition="#italic">December 13,
                        1905</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>This city continues quiet. Horacistas and President announce complete
                    reconciliation. Full account incident, with correspondence exchanged, will be
                    mailed December 20.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Dawson.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
